[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3242.71, "timestamp": "00:54:02", "text": "有些人会说“嗯，是的，外面有很多男性”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3247.23, "timestamp": "00:54:07", "text": "和 PPPO 一样，而不是 PPPO，SL Lo 插片"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3252.03, "timestamp": "00:54:12", "text": "插入物发出刀剑碰撞的声音。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3254.79, "timestamp": "00:54:14", "text": "对，就是这样。是哪部动画？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3257.67, "timestamp": "00:54:17", "text": "再次？嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3259.589, "timestamp": "00:54:19", "text": "呃，最近……的预览"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3261.43, "timestamp": "00:54:21", "text": "插曲。难道不会就此公布吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3263.069, "timestamp": "00:54:23", "text": "本周还是下周？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3267.75, "timestamp": "00:54:27", "text": "忘了。我指的是……呃……Loop 7。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3271.99, "timestamp": "00:54:31", "text": "嗯，就是那个……那个反派动漫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3275.069, "timestamp": "00:54:35", "text": "这明摆着就是她得到了一个“活力”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3278.71, "timestamp": "00:54:38", "text": "她正在融入军队，以便能够"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3281.15, "timestamp": "00:54:41", "text": "呃，弄把剑来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3282.75, "timestamp": "00:54:42", "text": "实践。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3285.51, "timestamp": "00:54:45", "text": "嗯，你会得到更多女孩的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3289.589, "timestamp": "00:54:49", "text": "不，我只是……我只是说说而已。好的。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3292.71, "timestamp": "00:54:52", "text": "意思是说，我的设计可能不会改变，大概吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3295.75, "timestamp": "00:54:55", "text": "但我只是想要长一点的头发。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3298.47, "timestamp": "00:54:58", "text": "你知道？你知道我总是怎么做的"}]